**Month 12:** TCS OA: attempt with 100 problems solved (should be 200+). Score 65% (need 70%). Fail. Infosys OA same week: fail due to inadequate prep. Amazon, Flipkart don't visit (campus already in placement phase).

**Month 13:** Only HCL and local companies remain. Clear HCL (₹2.8 LPA), not eligible for Amazon/Flipkart (campus phase ended). Peers who started Month 1 got Amazon (₹5+ LPA).

**Month 14:** Placed at HCL. Regret: 9 months of college without prep, then 2 months of cramming couldn't recover the lost time.

**Risk Level:** HIGH

**Root Cause:** Waiting 9 months before starting meant only 2 months for 200+ problems; placement window closes after campus drive, and starting late eliminated top-company opportunities.

**Alternate Path:** Start Month 1 (when college starts). Casual 1-2 hours/day for first 4 months. Intensive 3-4 hours/day from Month 5-8. Ready by Month 8 for early drives.

