## Example 15: Quitting job search after 1st rejection (timing mistake)
**Month 1:** Get offer from internship starting Month 3 (6-month term). Accept. Start placement prep.

**Month 2:** Prepare for placements while waiting for internship. 100 problems solved. Feeling good.

**Month 3:** Start internship. Work 40 hours/week. Placement prep reduced to 1 hour/day.

**Month 3-5 (Internship period):** Internship is engaging. Forget about placement prep. DSA skills decay.

**Month 6:** Internship ends (scheduled 6-month term). Month 6 is end of placement season (most campus drives over). Frantically restart placement prep.

**Month 6.5:** Few companies left. Get HCL offer (₹2.8 LPA). Peers who did internship BEFORE placements or skipped internship got TCS/Infosys (₹3.5 LPA).

**Risk Level:** MEDIUM

**Root Cause:** Timing the internship overlapping with placement season meant low-energy placement prep during internship; should have done internship before placement season or after.

**Alternate Path:** Internship in Month 1-3 (ends before placements). Placements Month 4-6. Or: internship Month 7-12 (after placements).

