## Example 21: Scheduling interviews right after college exams (exhaustion timing)
**Week 1-2 (Month 12):** College final exams. Hard subjects. Study 10 hours/day.

**Week 3 (Month 12):** Exams end Friday. Amazon interview scheduled for Saturday. Mental exhaustion.

**Saturday:** Interview 1 hour. But tired from exams. Coding speed slow. Solved 1 of 2 problems. Rejected.

